---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Newsletter"
  description="Iscriviti alla newsletter di TRAMA Studio. Ogni settimana un materiale tessile spiegato bene. Gratis, niente spam."
>

  <section style="background-color: #F5F1EA;" class="py-24 md:py-36 px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-editorial mx-auto">

      <p class="occhiello text-terracotta mb-6">Newsletter</p>

      <h1 style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: #111111; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Ogni settimana, un materiale spiegato bene
      </h1>

      <p style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #5C4033; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        Gratis. Niente spam. Disiscriviti quando vuoi.
      </p>

      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="sib-form" style="text-align:center; background-color:#111111;">
          <div id="sib-form-container" class="sib-form-container">
            <div id="error-message" class="sib-form-message-panel" style="font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:left; color:#661d1d; background-color:#ffeded; border-color:#ff4949; border-radius:3px; max-width:540px;">
              <div class="sib-form-message-panel__text sib-form-message-panel__text--center">
                <span class="sib-form-message-panel__inner-text">La tua iscrizione non può essere convalidata.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="success-message" class="sib-form-message-panel" style="font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:left; color:#085229; background-color:#e7faf0; border-color:#13ce66; border-radius:3px; max-width:540px;">
              <div class="sib-form-message-panel__text sib-form-message-panel__text--center">
                <span class="sib-form-message-panel__inner-text">Benvenuto in TRAMA Studio. Controlla la tua casella email.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="sib-container" class="sib-container--large sib-container--vertical" style="max-width:540px; text-align:center; background-color:rgba(26,26,26,1); border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:#d8c7b8; border-radius:3px; direction:ltr">
              <form id="sib-form" method="POST" action="https://1dea74ff.sibforms.com/serve/MUIFAOl2Hs03VOoSQ-Y2nBj7rO8jLw4AB-7mPiIcghwFn5GuwXOygBOCIDcCk0Ad7e5rcpDjZSWSHNPfPBR7UrvzIlM19JkAc7Dk9Is07ptDJdNQwJNJxng3l-vfQHrDHZl0qTwmP-WEMFZSZHv8inxq8umJnupMNiqujxaJPK5OAJGtucke9ry3IEzxPnYkGlq9YDvW-aHImTKB_A==" data-type="subscription">
                <div style="padding:8px 0;">
                  <div class="sib-form-block" style="font-family:Garamond,serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:700; text-align:left; color:#f5f1ea; background-color:transparent;">
                    <p>Il linguaggio nascosto dei tessuti</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="padding:8px 0;">
                  <div class="sib-form-block" style="font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:16px; text-align:left; color:#a9a29a; background-color:transparent;">
                    <div class="sib-text-form-block">
                      <p>Ogni settimana, un materiale spiegato bene. Gratis, niente spam, disiscriviti quando vuoi.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="padding:8px 0;">
                  <div class="sib-input sib-form-block">
                    <div class="form__entry entry_block">
                      <div class="form__label-row">
                        <label class="entry__label" style="font-weight:700; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:16px; color:#f5f1ea;" for="EMAIL" data-required="*">Il tuo indirizzo email</label>
                        <div class="entry__field">
                          <input class="input" type="text" id="EMAIL" name="EMAIL" autocomplete="off" value="" placeholder="EMAIL" data-required="true" required />
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <label class="entry__error entry__error--primary" style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:left; color:#661d1d; background-color:#ffeded; border-color:#ff4949; border-radius:3px;"></label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="padding:8px 0;">
                  <div class="sib-form-block" style="text-align:left;">
                    <button class="sib-form-block__button sib-form-block__button-with-loader" style="font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#f5f1ea; background-color:#a65a3a; border-width:0px; border-radius:3px;" form="sib-form" type="submit">
                      ISCRIVITI
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <input type="text" name="email_address_check" value="" class="input--hidden">
                <input type="hidden" name="locale" value="it">
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr style="border: none; border-top: 0.5px solid #D8C7B8; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;" />

      <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: #A65A3A; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.5;">—</span>
          <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5C4033; max-width: none;">
            <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 500;">Un materiale alla volta.</strong> Ogni numero si concentra su un tema: una fibra, un processo, un termine che vale la pena capire davvero.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: #A65A3A; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.5;">—</span>
          <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5C4033; max-width: none;">
            <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 500;">Nessun'agenda commerciale.</strong> TRAMA Studio non vende prodotti, non fa sponsorizzazioni, non spinge verso nessun brand. Solo informazione tessile curata.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: #A65A3A; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.5;">—</span>
          <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5C4033; max-width: none;">
            <strong style="color: #111111; font-weight: 500;">Leggerla richiede cinque minuti.</strong> È scritta per chi vuole capire, non per chi vuole essere sommerso. Densa il giusto, leggera quanto basta.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
